# What gets uploaded to Cloud Build as the source context.
#
# This file must exist. Without it gcloud falls back to .gitignore, which excludes data/ —
# and the app would deploy with no corpus at all (every query would return nothing).
# Deliberately NO "#!include:.gitignore" here for that exact reason.
#
# Mirrors .dockerignore: ship the source PDFs + SQLite + the chunked index; leave out the
# rendered page PNGs (derived data, ~738 MB, regenerated on demand at serve time) and the
# late-interaction visual index (measured out of the champion config).

# Rendered page images — regenerated on first view from data/pages/*/filing.pdf
data/pages/**/*.png

# Indexes the champion doesn't serve from
data/qdrant/collection/sightline_visual
data/qdrant/collection/sightline_text

# Machine-local cache and secrets never leave this box
data/llm_cache.db
.env

# Dev-only
.git
.github
.venv
venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
tests
docs
SIGHTLINE_BUILD_BIBLE.pdf
